  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "光景bóng uē - 泅過日月潭"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《泅過日月潭》</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">/林麗能</span></h2><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjpTozRgsHi2tgPL2vxX-LWAKHEl_2ObkLch5qyGyAat1PEERZtE6FZHbD9Pf1VBgTPErQGwgC7382s-f9WMe936B6oJXJJg3_WI7k9esEypxCge_udFHZw3yePsAetoJFWW6jSJ-SITjh9JDBxR0ijAfgQnbkGaXFrMgjHQIX8hlRT9uQo0Ef3H7gMHD14\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjpTozRgsHi2tgPL2vxX-LWAKHEl_2ObkLch5qyGyAat1PEERZtE6FZHbD9Pf1VBgTPErQGwgC7382s-f9WMe936B6oJXJJg3_WI7k9esEypxCge_udFHZw3yePsAetoJFWW6jSJ-SITjh9JDBxR0ijAfgQnbkGaXFrMgjHQIX8hlRT9uQo0Ef3H7gMHD14=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEicWSdiuO2y44QRVfoGrwz90tum14ZTaJMUnd0jTbPVlQSwkTZ3iKz71suzels8_9Ct0RpfMRmAQoGEOTNMLnxU5gGfSu4AQ2Rn3WmRvzJ6cQ9FUsHvO5Wo6YN_-kLGKQZ2lWCFET-nsiExvLqomProj7gCdGp92JZfUGXkH6qAJAtHmrlcw3QJSDl_KpTN\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEicWSdiuO2y44QRVfoGrwz90tum14ZTaJMUnd0jTbPVlQSwkTZ3iKz71suzels8_9Ct0RpfMRmAQoGEOTNMLnxU5gGfSu4AQ2Rn3WmRvzJ6cQ9FUsHvO5Wo6YN_-kLGKQZ2lWCFET-nsiExvLqomProj7gCdGp92JZfUGXkH6qAJAtHmrlcw3QJSDl_KpTN=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">透早5點，天iáu拍phú仔光，阮「透早泅水隊」就坐遊覽車uì斗六出發，tī車底逐家kha-lá-óo-khe輪流唱kah真樂暢。Gâu煮食ê隊友昨暝就kā好料--ê tshuân好勢，滷豆乾、飯丸、塗豆糖，紮tsiūnn車pun hōo逐家食kah真歡喜。Tī車底，隊長代先五人一組分好勢，交代仝隊--ê ài sio照顧。萬不二若身體無拄好，m̄免驚惶，浮thāng mooh hōo tiâu，帽仔褪掉，pûn pi仔，對天頂ia̍t手，救生員liam-mi就到位。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Tse是我頭一擺參加tsit个活動，心肝內小可仔tám-tám，雖bóng有冗早練體力，逐工透早泅水1,000公尺，一禮拜排三工ê下晡時，運動埕走五公里，歇睏日去附近ê山頂騎鐵馬往回20公里，連suà三月日，m̄知án-ne kám有法度泅過3,300公尺去到尾站——伊達邵碼頭。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Tsiah 7點外就到日月潭--ah！遠遠聽著鬧熱滾滾加油ê鑼鼓聲，目睭前看著水面已經有一陣人leh泅水--ah，戴紅色ê泅水帽仔，浮tī水面kánn-ná是一粒一粒紅色ê雞胿仔，後壁尾koh拖一條一條ê魚雷浮thāng。Ooh！原來第一批身障ê泅水客7點就落水--ah。環湖公路無kài闊，落車步lián行十外分鐘tsiah到泅水頭起站——朝霧碼頭。逐家淺拖仔收--起-來縛tiâu tī浮thāng尾，戴主辦單位規定ê泅水帽仔，我koh詳細檢查防水袋kám有縛ân，內底囥健保卡、手機仔、tsioo-kóo-lè-tòo kah 100箍ê銀票。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">拄落水lio̍h-lio̍h仔驚驚，跤踏bē著底，水濁濁、gàn-gàn，逐家lóng用四跤仔泅，頭殼一下起一下落。頭前後壁泅水客e-e陣陣，bē輸菜市仔hiah-nī鬧熱。沿途tio̍h斟酌mài kah人泅siunn倚，khah bē hōo人làm--著。阮仝隊--ê lóng tī身軀邊，互相顧頭顧尾，逐家khuann-khuann仔泅，無beh sái盡磅，khah免落尾失力泅bē到位。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">頭殼頂有直升機leh se̍h來se̍h去，攝影記者直接放送活動內容hōo全國知影。有一陣勇跤--ê，ná泅ná唱歌，喙ta ê人就泅倚去補給船邊，喙thí--開，志工就kā水倒落喉。兩點外鐘後，泅kah kiōng-beh ē khoo雞bē pûn火--ah，目睭前一陣suí查某囡仔啦啦隊，tī-leh huah「加油、加油」，kánn-ná leh迎接提金牌ê英雄，薑母茶、運動涼水隨tu倚--來，清涼ê水tshiâng四箍liàn-tńg tsuānn tī身軀頂，ná是免錢ê SPA hiah-nī爽快。泅tsiūnn岸邊，頭殼lio̍h-lio̍h仔眩眩，志工好禮仔kā我扶--起-來，hōo我坐落來歇喘，越頭揣我ê隊員，in mā隨个仔隨个泅起來岸邊，逐家雖bóng跤痠手軟，m̄-koh，泅過日月潭，挑戰成功ê笑容，kánn-ná leh講：「Suí--őo！明年beh koh來。」</span></div></div><div style=\"font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">編註：Tsit篇是2024年ê投稿，今年『泳渡日月潭』ê活動日期是tī 9/28。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 